Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Keep it trusted without becoming another task (finals)

- Claude layer (src/ai.js): free-text questions (/api/ask), automatic
  classification of connector content (/api/ingest), semantic agreement
  between sources, summaries; transparent keyword fallback without a key
- Who really knows (src/expertise.js): expertise learned from work signals
  (chat answers, tickets, commits, edits, confirmations) that fade with time
- Steward (src/steward.js): background sweep with an attention budget,
  one-click checks (conflict, handover, still correct?, publish chat answer),
  HR role-change webhook, expert replies captured as draft sources
- Freshness counts from the last one-click confirmation; an owner who left
  the role no longer counts as accountable
- Schema v2: verification, lifecycle, signals, verifications, activity
- Calm UI: discreet green answer, one-click checks, behind-the-scenes log,
  simulated Teams reply and connector events
- 7 new tests (45 total), extended CLI demo, README cleaned (merge leftover)

